# The functions of Mission_IgorFirstContact in level gamblinden (the script levels/gamblinden/scripts/mission_igorfirstcontact.py of data03.packed) that are data: one section
# per function, its parameters after the name. The other functions of the script are C (src/game/Script/levels/GamblinDen.c): Init, TalkToCrazyGambler, CrazyGamblerSpeech, TalkToIgor, IgorSpeech, TalkToMercenaries, MercenaryASpeech, MercenaryCSpeech, MercenaryBSpeech.
# Made by a converter from the script. A pack in mods/ with scrapc/levels/gamblinden/mission_igorfirstcontact.def replaces this file.
section InitStatus LevelPath

section SetNextMission
call SaveGame.QWayPoint
call MissionsFuncs.ActivateTarget %Mission_IgorFirstContact.mercA 0
call MissionsFuncs.ActivateTarget %Mission_IgorFirstContact.mercB 0
